    REFUSE "the Interpretation Act 1978 has no rule for counting a period of days from a day"

@ref Interpretation Act 1978, searched in full: no section counts a period of weeks; Sch 1 does not define "week" (see NOTES.md)
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the Interpretation Act 1978 has no rule for counting a period of weeks from a day` MEANS
    REFUSE "the Interpretation Act 1978 has no rule for counting a period of weeks from a day"

